# Technical Specifications: realkevbase.com

## Stack
- Backend: C# / .NET 10 Minimal APIs, Stripe SDK.
- Frontend: React + Material UI (MUI) SPA.

## Backend Rules (RealKevbase.Api)
- Organize endpoints logically in `Endpoints/` using route groups.
- Product models must distinguish `FulfillmentType.DigitalPdf` from `FulfillmentType.PhysicalMerch`.
- Process Stripe payment webhooks asynchronously; do not block HTTP responses.
- PDF download links must use Azure Blob Storage SAS presigned URLs valid for 24 hours.

## Frontend Rules (realkevbase-web)
- Use Material UI components (`Grid`, `Card`, `Drawer`) for the layout.
- Cart state must handle mixed orders (PDFs + Merch) seamlessly.
